OL,3,GNEWSAFormer sergeant charged with
OL,4,Aabusing position - IOPC
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former Derbyshire police officer has
OL,7,Fbeen charged over claims he abused his
OL,8,Fposition to try and form improper
OL,9,Fsexual or emotional relationships with
OL,10,Fwomen.
OL,12,FThe Independent Office for Police
OL,13,FConduct (IOPC) said Tarjinderjit Nizzer
OL,14,Fhas been charged with eight counts of
OL,15,Fmisconduct in public office following
OL,16,Fan investigation by Derbyshire
OL,17,FConstabulary's Counter Corruption Unit.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
