OL,3,GNEWSAFormer sergeant charged with
OL,4,Aabusing position - IOPC
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe former sergeant is accused of
OL,7,Fcontacting six members of the public
OL,8,Fand two police officers to instigate a
OL,9,Fsexual or otherwise inappropriate
OL,10,Frelationship between January 2020 and
OL,11,FNovember 2024.
OL,13,FThe 57-year-old has also been charged
OL,14,Fwith attempting to pervert the course
OL,15,Fof justice and computer misuse.
